          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 22.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said to me, “And now, Daniel, close the book and put a seal on it until the end of the world. Meanwhile, many people will waste their efforts trying to understand what is happening.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I saw two men standing by a river, one on each bank. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One of them asked the angel who was standing further upstream, “How long will it be until these amazing events come to an end?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
