            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.10.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 10.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.12.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The angel raised both hands towards the sky and made a solemn promise in the name of the Eternal God. I heard him say, “It will be 3.5 years. When the persecution of God's people ends, all these things will have happened.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I heard what he said, but I did not understand it. So I asked, “But, sir, how will it all end?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He answered, “You must go now, Daniel, because these words are to be kept secret and hidden until the end comes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 22.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Many people will be purified. Those who are wicked will not understand but will go on being wicked; only those who are wise will understand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
